# A call's keywords were counted as one more positional argument, so an
# untyped `thing.refresh(name: "b")` did not fit `def refresh(name: nil)`
# and `--refs` excluded it: "the argument count does not fit". Keywords
# handed to a method that takes keywords are its keywords; to one that takes
# none they are one positional Hash, as Ruby passes them.
refs Widget#refresh confirmed=1 possible=1
refs Widget#resize confirmed=1 possible=1
refs Widget#label confirmed=1 possible=1
